"""Practical installation, data, prediction and training guide."""


def quickstart(en):
    t=lambda a,b:a if en else b
    text='# '+t('Quick start','快速开始')+'\n\n'
    text+=t('This tutorial takes you from installation to loading an NMR record, predicting chemical shifts and training a model with your own data. Run the commands from the cloned repository so the example files are available.\n\n','本教程从安装开始，依次介绍如何读取 NMR 记录、预测化学位移，以及用自己的数据训练模型。命令在克隆后的仓库根目录运行，示例文件位于仓库中。\n\n')
    portal='https://jiaqingxie.github.io/openmolspec.github.io/'
    text += t(
        f'## Use the website\n\nOpen the [workspace]({portal}#tool) to choose a task and inspect its inputs and outputs. The [sucrose example]({portal}#tool-sucrose) loads 11 measured (¹³C, ¹H) HSQC pairs from BMRB bmse000119 in D₂O. Its ¹H and ¹³C traces come from the same sample.\n\n'
        f'In [Explore]({portal}#dataset), choose a spectrum type and enter SMILES. An exact structure match returns experimental records with provenance. An available predictor handles missing NMR, IR or Raman records. For MS/MS prediction, specify acquisition conditions in the workspace. Browse the paired examples for site-based NMR R² and peak matching. The [Harness gallery]({portal}#agent-demo) opens recorded calls without an API key. Live questions require a configured model provider.\n\n',
        f'## 使用网页\n\n在[工作台]({portal}?lang=zh#tool)中选择任务，查看输入和输出。[蔗糖案例]({portal}?lang=zh#tool-sucrose)可载入 BMRB bmse000119 在重水中的 11 组实测（¹³C，¹H）HSQC 峰对。首页的氢谱和碳谱来自同一样品。\n\n'
        f'在[数据探索]({portal}?lang=zh#dataset)中选择谱种并输入 SMILES。命中同结构记录时可查看实验谱及来源，缺少对应核磁、红外或拉曼记录时调用已部署的预测器。预测 MS/MS 时请在工作台填写采集条件。配对案例可查看基于独立位点标注的核磁 R² 与峰位匹配。[智能体案例]({portal}?lang=zh#agent-demo)支持免密钥回放，实时提问需要服务端配置模型提供方。\n\n')
    text+='## '+t('1. Install OpenMolSpec','1. 安装 OpenMolSpec')+'\n\n'
    text+=t('Use Python 3.10 or newer. Create an environment and install the package with data-format and plotting dependencies.\n\n','使用 Python 3.10 或更新版本。创建环境后，安装工具包及数据格式、绘图依赖。\n\n')
    text+='```bash\ngit clone --branch release/openmolspec-v1 https://github.com/jiaqingxie/openmolspec-studio-frontend.git\ncd openmolspec-studio-frontend\npython3 -m venv .venv\nsource .venv/bin/activate\npython -m pip install --upgrade pip\npython -m pip install -e ".[data,analysis]"\n```\n\n'
    text+=t('For an existing installation, the [v1.0 release](https://github.com/jiaqingxie/openmolspec-studio-frontend/releases/tag/v1.0) also provides a wheel. The release branch contains the current dataset cards and manual examples.\n\n','[v1.0 发布页](https://github.com/jiaqingxie/openmolspec-studio-frontend/releases/tag/v1.0)也提供 wheel 安装包。release 分支包含当前数据卡与手册示例。\n\n')
    text+='## '+t('2. Read your first spectrum','2. 读取第一条谱')+'\n\n'
    text+=t('Start with the three NMRSpec example molecules included in the repository. `MolecularSpectra` creates a dataset with named splits; a split streams records from its file. `head(1)` reads the first record.\n\n','先读取仓库自带的三个 NMRSpec 示例分子。`MolecularSpectra` 按名称组织数据划分，每个划分从文件逐条读取；`head(1)` 返回第一条记录。\n\n')
    text+='```python\nfrom openmolspec.dataset import MolecularSpectra\n\nexamples = MolecularSpectra.from_jsonl(\n    splits={"test": "documentation/assets/sdk-nmr-test-examples.jsonl"},\n    name="nmrspec_examples", domain="experimental")\nrecord = examples["test"].head(1)[0]\nprint(record["smiles"])\nprint(record["formula"])\nprint(record["c_nmr"])\n```\n\n'
    text+=t('`smiles` describes the molecule, `formula` stores its molecular formula, and `h_nmr`/`c_nmr` contain the experimental spectral records. `_openmolspec` records the dataset name, split and available channels.\n\n','`smiles` 描述分子结构，`formula` 保存分子式，`h_nmr`／`c_nmr` 保存实验谱记录。`_openmolspec` 记录数据集名称、划分和可用通道。\n\n')
    text+='## '+t('3. Load a complete dataset','3. 加载完整数据集')+'\n\n'
    text+=t('For the cleaned OpenDataLab H/C collection, put `train.jsonl`, `val.jsonl` and `test.jsonl` in `data/nmr`, then open the registered dataset.\n\n','使用清洗后的 OpenDataLab H/C 集合时，将 `train.jsonl`、`val.jsonl`、`test.jsonl` 放在 `data/nmr`，再按注册名称加载。\n\n')
    text+='```python\nfrom openmolspec.dataset import molspectra, list_datasets\n\nprint([card["name"] for card in list_datasets()])\ndata = molspectra("opendatalab_nmr", root="data/nmr")\npaired = data["train"].select(modalities=["1H", "13C"], limit=100)\nfor molecule in paired.head(3):\n    print(molecule["smiles"], molecule["h_peaks_ppm"])\nprint(data.verify())\n```\n\n'
    text+=t('The channel filter selects molecules containing both H and C spectra. `verify()` checks the local files against the dataset version. See [Data](data/index.md) for cleaned counts, per-nucleus files, experimental conditions and other supported resources.\n\n','通道筛选会选择同时含 H、C 谱的分子。`verify()` 核对本地文件与数据版本是否一致。[数据指南](data/index.md)提供清洗后数量、各核种文件、实验条件及其他资源。\n\n')
    text+='## '+t('4. Predict chemical shifts','4. 预测化学位移')+'\n\n'
    text+=t('NMRNet uses its released model files and Python environment. Set `models_root` to the directory containing `nmrnet/`, and `python` to the interpreter with the NMRNet dependencies. The [model guide](tasks/nmr-forward-13C.md) describes the files and nucleus settings.\n\n','NMRNet 使用发布的模型文件和对应 Python 环境。`models_root` 指向包含 `nmrnet/` 的目录，`python` 指向安装了 NMRNet 依赖的解释器。[模型指南](tasks/nmr-forward-13C.md)介绍所需文件及核种设置。\n\n')
    text+='```python\nfrom openmolspec.model import NMRNet\n\nmodel = NMRNet.from_pretrained(\n    "models", nucleus="13C", python="/path/to/nmr-env/bin/python")\nresult = model.predict("CCO")\nprint(result["records"][0]["atom_indices"])\nprint(result["records"][0]["prediction_ppm"])\n```\n\n'
    text+=t('The ethanol example returns carbon atom indices `[0, 1]` and shifts of approximately `[17.774, 57.774]` ppm. Atom indices follow zero-based RDKit atom ordering after adding hydrogens. Use these indices to attach each shift to the molecular graph.\n\n','乙醇示例返回碳原子编号 `[0, 1]`，位移约为 `[17.774, 57.774]` ppm。原子编号遵循 RDKit 加氢后的 0 起始顺序，可用这些编号把位移标到分子图上。\n\n')
    text+='## '+t('5. Compare with measurements and save the result','5. 与实测峰比较并保存结果')+'\n\n'
    text+='```python\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom openmolspec.benchmark import evaluate_nmr\n\nmetrics = evaluate_nmr(result, [[18.2, 58.3]])\nprint(metrics)\nPath("ethanol-prediction.json").write_text(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\nmodel.save_config("nmrnet-config.json")\nrestored = NMRNet.from_config("nmrnet-config.json")\n```\n\n'
    text+=t('`evaluate_nmr` matches predicted and observed peak positions and returns the error and matching coverage. The JSON result contains the atomwise predictions and model provenance. The configuration file records the model settings for later use.\n\n','`evaluate_nmr` 匹配预测峰与实测峰，并返回误差和覆盖率。结果 JSON 保存逐原子预测及模型来源；配置文件保存模型设置，便于后续加载。\n\n')
    text+='## '+t('6. Train with your own NMR data','6. 使用自己的 NMR 数据训练')+'\n\n'
    text+=t('Install the training dependencies. Prepare separate training and validation JSONL files using the H/C schema in [Data](data/nmr.md): every record supplies a molecular structure, formula, spectrum text and channel mask.\n\n','先安装训练依赖，再按 [NMR 字段格式](data/nmr.md)准备独立的训练、验证 JSONL 文件。每条记录包含分子结构、分子式、谱文本与通道掩码。\n\n')
    text+='```bash\npython -m pip install -e ".[train]"\n```\n\n'
    text+='```python\nfrom openmolspec.dataset import MolecularSpectra\nfrom openmolspec.training import prepare_nmr_training\nfrom openmolspec.model import NMRTransformer\n\ncustom = MolecularSpectra.from_jsonl(\n    splits={"train": "train.jsonl", "val": "val.jsonl"},\n    name="my_nmr", domain="experimental")\nprepared = prepare_nmr_training(\n    custom["train"], custom["val"], "prepared-nmr")\nmodel = NMRTransformer(stage="align", device="cpu")\nplan = model.training_plan(\n    prepared, run_dir="runs/my-encoder", epochs=10, batch_size=32)\nprint(plan.validate())\ntrained = model.fit(plan)\nprint(trained)\n```\n\n'
    text+=t('Preparation checks formulas, nucleus labels and train/validation molecular overlap. The alignment stage learns a shared spectrum–molecule representation. For structure generation, use `stage="generate"` and provide the saved alignment checkpoint. The [training tutorial](notebooks/sdk-training-preflight.ipynb) walks through preparation, configuration, checkpoint saving and reloading.\n\n','数据准备会检查分子式、核种标签及训练／验证分子重叠。对齐阶段学习共享的谱与分子表征。训练结构生成器时使用 `stage="generate"`，并提供保存的对齐 checkpoint。[训练教程](notebooks/sdk-training-preflight.ipynb)逐步介绍数据准备、参数配置、权重保存与重载。\n\n')
    text+='## '+t('Next steps','继续学习')+'\n\n'
    text+='- [Tasks](tasks/index.md): '+t('inputs, outputs and model calls for every spectroscopy task.','每个谱学任务的输入、输出与模型调用。')+'\n'
    text+='- [Tutorials](notebooks/index.md): '+t('executed examples, plots and explanations.','已执行的示例、图与解释。')+'\n'
    text+='- [API reference](api-reference/index.md): '+t('classes, signatures, parameters and return values.','类、签名、参数与返回值。')+'\n'
    text+='- [Agent Harness](harness.md): '+t('Python, CLI and MCP spectroscopy tools.','Python、CLI 与 MCP 谱学工具。')+'\n'
    return text
